---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
import PageBanner from "../components/PageBanner.astro";
---

<Layout title="Get involved">
  <PageBanner slot="banner" title="Volunteering" />

  <div class="pt-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 auto-rows-auto">
      <div
        class="md:col-span-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-weegee-teal bg-weegee-teal group relative"
      >
        <img
          src="/assets/volunteering/welcome_pack_volunteers.webp"
          alt="Two people smiling making up welcome packs"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-xl"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div
        class="md:col-span-7 bg-weegee-white rounded-xl p-8 border-2 border-weegee-teal flex flex-col justify-center gap-4"
      >
        <h2
          class="text-3xl text-weegee-teal border-b pb-2 border-weegee-teal/10"
        >
          Join us!
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed">
          We couldn't do what we do without our volunteers. Whether you can give
          us an hour or a whole weekend, your time can make a real difference to
          Refuweegee and the thousands of people who come through our doors each
          week. Our volunteering opportunities are subject to change depending
          on what we need and when people are available. If you'd like to find
          out what we're currently looking for or find out more, email us at
          <a href="mailto:volunteering@refuweegee.co.uk" class="link-teal">
            volunteering@refuweegee.co.uk
          </a>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed">
          We also run regular volunteer socials at our George Square HQ. These
          are a great way to meet the team and get to know the space before you
          volunteer. We encourage everyone to come and spend some time in the
          space first, as you'll get a better feel for Refuweegee and what
          volunteering here is like.
        </p>
        <p>
          We regularly run events at George Square—an excellent way to get
          familiar with our space! We encourage everyone to use our space before
          volunteering in it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="md:col-span-6 bg-weegee-white rounded-xl p-8 border-2 border-weegee-teal flex flex-col justify-center gap-4"
      >
        <h2 class="text-3xl border-b pb-2 border-weegee-black/10">
          Corporate volunteering
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed">
          We're always amazed by how much one team can get done in a day. We
          regularly welcome corporate groups of up to 12 people who dedicate
          their time to help with the work that keeps Refuweegee going. What
          you'll do depends on what we need that day. You might help sort
          donations in the shop or spend some time chatting with our visitors.
          Sometimes the simplest things, like offering a hot drink and a chat,
          can make someone feel welcome. If your team would like to volunteer
          with us, get in touch with Lily, our Corporate Relations Coordinator,
          at <a href="mailto:volunteering@refuweegee.co.uk" class="link-teal"
            >volunteering@refuweegee.co.uk</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="md:col-span-6 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-weegee-teal bg-weegee-teal group relative"
      >
        <img
          src="/assets/volunteering/shop_volunteers.webp"
          alt="Three people volunteering in the Refuweegee shop"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-xl"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div
        class="md:col-span-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-weegee-teal bg-weegee-teal group relative"
      >
        <img
          src="/assets/volunteering/stacking_rails.webp"
          alt="Woman in green Scottish Power volunteers t-shirt stacking clothing rails"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-xl"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div
        class="md:col-span-7 bg-weegee-white rounded-xl p-8 border-2 border-weegee-teal flex flex-col justify-center gap-4"
      >
        <h2
          class="text-3xl text-weegee-teal border-b pb-2 border-weegee-teal/10"
        >
          Local partners
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed">
          Refuweegee started in Glasgow, and being a local weegie charity is a
          core part of who we are. We're lucky to have built strong
          relationships with people and organisations across the city.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed">
          We've worked with local schools and universities, community
          organisations, the NHS and other charities. We've also worked with
          people across Glasgow's creative and cultural communities, from
          musicians and photographers to artists and reporters. These
          relationships have helped us increase our visibility and build a
          strong community around our mission. Local businesses have also been
          crucial for our work. Some have supported us through donations or
          fundraising, while others have hosted donation drop off points. You
          can currently find donation drop-off points at Vanilla Ink and Glasgow
          Heritage Trust.
        </p>
        <p>
          We're grateful to everyone who has shared our work or found a way to
          get involved. Glasgow is a city full of people who care about their
          community, and those connections are a huge part of what makes
          Refuweegee possible. If you're a local organisation or business and
          would like to work with us, we'd love to hear from you! Get in touch
          at <a href="mailto:enquiries@refuweegee.co.uk" class="link-teal"
            >enquiries@refuweegee.co.uk</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
